<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>If you wish to find the Lord,</l><l>Do not seek Him in the mind,</l><l>For the mind can only know, it cannot taste.</l><l>It cannot taste, it cannot taste,</l><l>It cannot taste, it cannot taste,</l><l>For the mind can only know, it cannot taste.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>If you wish to find the Lord,</l><l>You must open up your heart,</l><l>You must open up your heart and let Him in.</l><l>Let Him in, let Him in,</l><l>Let Him in, let Him in,</l><l>You must open up your heart and let Him in.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>If you wish to let Him in,</l><l>You just call upon His name,</l><l>You just call upon His name and let Him in.</l><l>Call His name, call His name,</l><l>Call His name, call His name,</l><l>You just call upon His name and let Him in.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
